{"id":"ed457575028b1d57","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed.md","title":"显示映射的相对闭性与强结构","display":"df-relatively-cartesian-closed — 显示映射的相对闭性与强结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed","aliases":["16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed","Relatively cartesian closed category"],"display":"df-relatively-cartesian-closed — 显示映射的相对闭性与强结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-display-map-category]]","[[16-df-display-fibration]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Definition 10.4.1, p. 610 (PDF 630); discussion p. 611 (PDF 631)","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed</span><span>Relatively cartesian closed category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relatively-cartesian-closed — 显示映射的相对闭性与强结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa153f5cc8052173\" href=\"?note=fa153f5cc8052173\" title=\"16-df-display-map-category\">16-df-display-map-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.4.1, p. 610 (PDF 630); discussion p. 611 (PDF 631)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fa153f5cc8052173\" href=\"?note=fa153f5cc8052173\" title=\"16-df-display-map-category\">16-df-display-map-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\mathcal D}=\\operatorname{cod}_{\\mathcal D}:\\mathbf D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p_{\\mathcal D}=\\operatorname{cod}_{\\mathcal D}:\\mathbf D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a>，固定提升选择；其纤维写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D/I\">\\(\\mathcal D/I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(d\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_d=\\operatorname{dom}d\">\\(X_d=\\operatorname{dom}d\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d\">\\(I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d\\)</span>。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的重索引为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d^*:\\mathcal D/I_d\\to\\mathcal D/X_d\">\\(d^*:\\mathcal D/I_d\\to\\mathcal D/X_d\\)</span>。候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_d:\\mathcal D/X_d\\to\\mathcal D/I_d\">\\(\\Pi_d:\\mathcal D/X_d\\to\\mathcal D/I_d\\)</span> 及伴随采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。</li>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(d\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span> 固定自身拉回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_d,a_d,b_d)\">\\((P_d,a_d,b_d)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_d,b_d:P_d\\to X_d\">\\(a_d,b_d:P_d\\to X_d\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a_d,b_d;d,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a_d,b_d;d,d)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq},\\mathrm{Iso}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq},\\mathrm{Iso}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_d\">\\(\\delta_d\\)</span> 在下文由该拉回泛性质定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p_{\\mathcal D};S)\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p_{\\mathcal D};S)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>，使用本页同一个选定伴随族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)\\)</span> 及由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 产生的单位、余单位采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>；下文量化的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_d\">\\(\\Phi_d\\)</span> 都是该定义的候选 Hom 映射族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DisplayUnit},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongEq},\\mathrm{DisplayProducts},\\mathrm{RCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{DisplayUnit},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongEq},\\mathrm{DisplayProducts},\\mathrm{RCCC}\\)</span> 为本页定义；所有态射的复合采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 的指定复合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DisplayUnit}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(f)\\Longrightarrow f\\in\\mathcal D\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall d,e\\in\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{cod}e=\\operatorname{dom}d\\Longrightarrow d\\circ e\\in\\mathcal D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DisplayUnit}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(f)\\Longrightarrow f\\in\\mathcal D\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall d,e\\in\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{cod}e=\\operatorname{dom}d\\Longrightarrow d\\circ e\\in\\mathcal D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(X_d,P_d))\\ &amp;(a_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}\\land b_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}),\\\\\n(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\ \\bigl(\\delta_d=h\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nh\\in\\mathcal B(X_d,P_d)\\land a_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}\\land b_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DisplayStrongEq}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D)\\ \\delta_d\\in\\mathcal D.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(X_d,P_d))\\ &amp;(a_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}\\land b_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}),\\\\\n(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\ \\bigl(\\delta_d=h\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nh\\in\\mathcal B(X_d,P_d)\\land a_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}\\land b_dh=\\operatorname{id}_{X_d}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DisplayStrongEq}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D)\\ \\delta_d\\in\\mathcal D.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DisplayProducts}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Pi_d,\\Phi_d)_{d\\in\\mathcal D})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(d^*,\\Pi_d,\\Phi_d)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D)(\\forall J,P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I_d))(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X_d))\n(\\forall d&#39;\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,d&#39;;d,u)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p_{\\mathcal D};(a,d&#39;,d,u);\\Pi_{d&#39;},\\Phi_{d&#39;},\\Pi_d,\\Phi_d)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DisplayProducts}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Pi_d,\\Phi_d)_{d\\in\\mathcal D})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(d^*,\\Pi_d,\\Phi_d)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D)(\\forall J,P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I_d))(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X_d))\n(\\forall d&#39;\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,d&#39;;d,u)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p_{\\mathcal D};(a,d&#39;,d,u);\\Pi_{d&#39;},\\Phi_{d&#39;},\\Pi_d,\\Phi_d)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCCC}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DisplayUnit}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{DisplayProducts}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RCCC}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DisplayUnit}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{DisplayProducts}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Definition 10.4.1 的 RCCC 恰好是 unit、product 与 strong sum；strong equality 是同页另列的独立条件，没有偷偷加入 RCCC 的定义。</li>\n<li>对角 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_d\">\\(\\delta_d\\)</span> 的存在唯一性由自身拉回对两条恒等箭头的泛性质直接得到。两种自身拉回顶点之间有保持两投影的同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:P_d\\to P&#39;_d\">\\(j:P_d\\to P&#39;_d\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\delta_d=\\delta&#39;_d\">\\(j\\delta_d=\\delta&#39;_d\\)</span>；沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^{-1}\">\\(j^{-1}\\)</span> 的拉回把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_d\">\\(\\delta_d\\)</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta&#39;_d\">\\(\\delta&#39;_d\\)</span>，因此显示映射的拉回闭性使强相等条件不依赖这个选择。</li>\n<li>product 的右伴随沿显示映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>，并非沿基底全部箭头。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}(a,d&#39;;d,u)\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}(a,d&#39;;d,u)\\)</span> 成立，拉回闭性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d&#39;\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(d&#39;\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>；因而所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{d&#39;}\">\\(\\Pi_{d&#39;}\\)</span> 存在于同一个候选族，BC mate 的两端及其伴随数据均有定义。方块四边顺序与被引用的 mate 定义一致。</li>\n<li>强和的复合闭性可产生弱和：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的左伴随把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:Y\\to X_d\">\\(e:Y\\to X_d\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"de:Y\\to I_d\">\\(de:Y\\to I_d\\)</span>。交换三角与拉回泛性质给出相应自然 Hom 双射，其换基由拉回拼接得到。本页只定义原书的强结构与 RCCC，没有把这项说明冒充另一个未展开的弱结构谓词。</li>\n<li>来源：Definition 10.4.1, p. 610（PDF 630）；讨论见 p. 611（PDF 631）。未声称所有依赖型演算或所有 comprehension 模型都满足这些附加条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-display-map-category","status":"resolved","id":"fa153f5cc8052173","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-map-category","status":"resolved","id":"fa153f5cc8052173","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)$ 采用 [[16-df-display-map-category]]。$p_{\\mathcal D}=\\operatorname{cod}_{\\mathcal D}:\\mathbf D\\to\\mathcal B$ 采用 [[16-df-display-fibration]]，固定提升选择；其纤维写作 $\\mathcal D/I$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)$ 采用 [[16-df-display-map-category]]。$p_{\\mathcal D}=\\operatorname{cod}_{\\mathcal D}:\\mathbf D\\to\\mathcal B$ 采用 [[16-df-display-fibration]]，固定提升选择；其纤维写作 $\\mathcal D/I$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d\\in\\mathcal D$，$X_d=\\operatorname{dom}d$，$I_d=\\operatorname{cod}d$。沿 $d$ 的重索引为 $d^*:\\mathcal D/I_d\\to\\mathcal D/X_d$。候选 $\\Pi_d:\\mathcal D/X_d\\to\\mathcal D/I_d$ 及伴随采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"每个 $d\\in\\mathcal D$ 固定自身拉回 $(P_d,a_d,b_d)$，其中 $a_d,b_d:P_d\\to X_d$，满足 $\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a_d,b_d;d,d)$。$\\mathrm{PbSq},\\mathrm{Iso}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]，$\\delta_d$ 在下文由该拉回泛性质定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p_{\\mathcal D};S)$ 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]，使用本页同一个选定伴随族。$\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)$ 及由 $\\Phi$ 产生的单位、余单位采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下文量化的每个 $\\Phi_d$ 都是该定义的候选 Hom 映射族。$\\mathrm{DisplayUnit},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongEq},\\mathrm{DisplayProducts},\\mathrm{RCCC}$ 为本页定义；所有态射的复合采用 $\\mathcal B$ 的指定复合。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p_{\\mathcal D};S)$ 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]，使用本页同一个选定伴随族。$\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)$ 及由 $\\Phi$ 产生的单位、余单位采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下文量化的每个 $\\Phi_d$ 都是该定义的候选 Hom 映射族。$\\mathrm{DisplayUnit},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongEq},\\mathrm{DisplayProducts},\\mathrm{RCCC}$ 为本页定义；所有态射的复合采用 $\\mathcal B$ 的指定复合。","embed":fals